<title>USA: Sonoco completes packaging group purchase.</title>
<headline>Sonoco completes packaging group purchase.</headline>
<dateline>HARTSVILLE, S.C. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonoco Products Co said Wednesday that it had completed its acquisition of the Specialty Packaging Group Inc, a Wisconsin-based producer of specialty packaging products.</p>
<p>Sonoco said in a release that the group, which averages $38 million in annual sales, would become part of Sonoco's consumer products division.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
